(footprint "Shield_Hammond_1551G_Box"
	(version 20260206)
	(generator "pcbnew")
	(generator_version "10.0")
	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "Hammond 1551G enclosure, BOX half only, inverted and used as the HV safety shield. Mechanical reference footprint -- no copper, no drills. Geometry measured from Hammond's own STEP, https://www.hammfg.com/files/parts/stp/1551GTBU.zip, plus the dimensioned drawing at https://www.hammfg.com/files/parts/pdf/1551GTBU.pdf. Unlike the 1551B this part is box + lid rather than two symmetric halves; the box is the deep piece and the lid is discarded. Box outer 50.000 x 35.000 x 17.000, open face down on the board. Interior clear height 15.050 mm; interior 44.73 x 29.73. Lid screw pattern 43.880 x 28.880, #4 x 1/2 in self-tapping. Four corner bosses run the full depth to the rim.")
	(tags "hammond 1551G enclosure shield mechanical")
